bp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=46f3664f6b8d9d067298639fa8d2988a 3x"}, "body": "初めまして。MOTSU様の可愛くて生き生きとした絵を拝見し、ずっと見ていたくなるような気持ちになりました。もしよろしければ、私のオリジナルキャラクター2人を描いていただけないでしょうか。\n\n▽キャラクター設定\n詳しいプロフィールは、以下の資料にまとめてあります。\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1UREOU-iqalLefrvwSO7JZSBb0nyr9oCG?usp=sharing\n\n構図や服装のご指定は特にありません。自分なりの解釈で、自由に描いて頂けると嬉しいです！\nなお、もし何かヒントがおありでないようでしたら、以下のようなシチュエーションも参考程度にご覧いただければ幸いです。ただ、あくまで自由に描いていただくのが大前提ですので、どうぞお気遣いなく。\n▽シチュエーション\n▪ 対局中、相手の長考の間にこっそり相手を観察する\n▪ ふとした瞬間に近づく\n▪ 獣耳の場合、片方が相手のしっぽを触りたがっている\n\nお忙しいところ恐れ入りますが、ご一読いただけますと幸いです。", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@mo_otsss/works/5", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3915570, "client_id": 667554, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/ec27e255/uploads/origins/56834068-8e19-4fa8-90a2-71810e1de211?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a3eff4ae3efd5a98adb1397bcb834c88", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ec27e255/uploads/origins/56834068-8e19-4fa8-90a2-71810e1de211?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a3eff4ae3efd5a98adb1397bcb834c88, https://si.imgix.net/ec27e255/uploads/origins/56834068-8e19-4fa8-90a2-71810e1de211?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9c6d20bbb5926d7e788ead793da5a00f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ec27e255/uploads/origins/56834068-8e19-4fa8-90a2-71810e1de211?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=99893bcb411023911f4deee3022cd697 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/ec27e255/uploads/origins/56834068-8e19-4fa8-90a2-71810e1de211?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=3510a2ace1d5f4a13c19732c3b681eff", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ec27e255/uploads/origins/56834068-8e19-4fa8-90a2-71810e1de211?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=3510a2ace1d5f4a13c19732c3b681eff, https://si.imgix.net/ec27e255/uploads/origins/56834068-8e19-4fa8-90a2-71810e1de211?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=6d9ad73c78f0112219fa7fe6a48d2791 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ec27e255/uploads/origins/56834068-8e19-4fa8-90a2-71810e1de211?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=45312d1bb4695ee89a494759f1d11594 3x"}, "body": "Hi! I'm sorry that my repeated requests may disturb you! This time I hope to request you with drawing another paro for OCs (Blanke and Side). \nReference link:https://sta.sh/22cum2aqg2kz\n\n○Characters\nBlanke(190cm): The young master of a large family. He is currently on the run and planning revenge due to family internal power struggles. Always expressionless and wearing sunglasses outside. He would get angry due to trivial matters and lack patience.\nSide(158cm): The abandoned android. His damaged body is found and repaired by Blanke, but due to the virus, there are occasional symptoms of mental confusion and amnesia. Will execute Blanke's commands very mechanically, and his stubborn behavior occasionally troubles. Usually, he has a serious expression. \n\n○Request \nPlease draw illustration according to their setting. \nRegarding the clothing design in the reference, if there are any parts that you cannot understand, you can modify them yourself.\n\nThank you so much for considering!", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@mo_otsss/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3915570, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/72640e0a/uploads/origins/0ea5d21f-c101-4091-a386-2bb014fcea55?bg=%23fff&auto=format%